        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova aneena na Mose, akĩmwĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neena na ana ma Isilaeli, ũkĩmea, Ethĩwa mũndũ mũka akaitava, na kũsyaa kavĩsĩ, nĩvo ĩndĩ wĩĩthĩwa mũvuku mĩthenya mũonza; o ta mĩthenyanĩ ya kũvathwa kwake kwondũ wa kwĩalũla kwake akeethĩwa mũvuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
